     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Ratan&#39;s users,<div><br></div><div>I would like to modify sigmaP where I want to fix sigmaP[1] = 1 and to estimate L_SigmaP. </div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">parameters {</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>vector[2] paramP[P]; // Parameters of persons (theta,tau)</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153);min-height:16px\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>cholesky_factor_corr[2] L_OmegaP;<br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>vector&lt;lower=0&gt;[2] sigmaP; </p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153);min-height:16px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">}</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153);min-height:16px\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">transformed parameters {</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>matrix[2,2] L_SigmaP;<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>L_SigmaP &lt;- diag_pre_multiply(sigmaP,L_OmegaP);</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><br></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">}</p></div><div><br></div><div>I tried to change the before script to define sigmaP1 in data an in parameters sigmaP2 and in <br></div><div>transformed parameters{</div><div><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">matrix[2,2] L_SigmaP;</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">vector&lt;lower=0&gt;[2] sigmaP;</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>sigmaP[1] &lt;- sigmaP1;</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\">        sigmaP[2] &lt;- sigmaP2;</p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><br></p><p style=\"margin-left:4px;line-height:normal;font-family:Casual;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>L_SigmaP &lt;- diag_pre_multiply(sigmaP,L_OmegaP);</p></div><div>}</div><div><br></div><div>It produces an error.</div><div><br></div><div>Bests, Eric</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
